Each block below runs EXPLAIN ANALYZE on one of the seven queries.
Read each plan from the inside out: the indented children are the
operations that feed the parent above them.
Look for: Seq Scan nodes (slow on big tables), execution time in ms,
actual loops, and rows removed by filters.

Paste each plan into before_after_table.md under the Before
columns BEFORE running indexes.sql.

